  "description": "Entity Framework 6 provider for Rmp.GraphOrm, for legacy .NET Framework apps. Speeds up slow EF6 Include/graph queries by loading the whole object graph in one SQL query with no duplicated rows. Reads your existing EF6 model, runs on the context's connection and transaction, no migration or schema changes; adopt it one screen at a time. Targets .NET Framework 4.6.2+ and .NET Standard 2.1. Report issues at https://github.com/rubiconmp/public-issues",
